      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Petitioner has challenged letter dated 5th September, 2018 issued by the authority, by which it proposed to determine and recover in respect of petitioner's contribution under section 45A of Employees' State Insurance Act, 1948 aggregate of Rs.3,22,394/-\nfor period of default June, 2013 to May, 2018 in respect of 9 covered employees.",
